    "NAME NORMALIZATION: trailing stellar-component letters stripped (GJ 15 A -> GJ 15; K2-148 A/B -> K2-148; TOI-1450 A -> TOI-1450). K2-148 A and B collapse to one key.",
    "Gl / Gliese / GJ unified as one catalogue prefix. No Gl<->GJ numeric ambiguity affected any match in this run.",
