    "'Additional hosts' = cool hosts in our 303-star sample that appear in the Gaidos+23 TIME Table but are not among our 12 pipeline gyro-age hosts. It does NOT mean those stars are usable in our Angus+19 gyrointerp model (Teff 3800-6200 K, Prot <= 45 d).",
